  "scope": "Two case-owned disposable kind Kubernetes v1.36.1 clusters: an intentionally incomplete red audit policy and a green policy with five explicit Request-level synthetic AI-family rules plus a Metadata catch-all. Exact ResponseComplete audit-file events are correlated to successful case-owned API creates, patches, fallback reads, and a harmless ConfigMap control. The green policy additionally captures actual update and delete verbs on these synthetic objects and verifies a metadata-only same-resource create in a second owned namespace. Invented CRDs cover the product categories. The native comparison adds owned batch Jobs, Deployments and ResourceClaims without workload or device allocation. Request bodies contain inert markers, and fallback events contain only metadata. No response bodies are logged.",
